---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> SOFTWARE ENGINEER & BUILDER</div>
  <h1>Engineering systems.<br>Crafting thoughtful <span class="hero-last-word"><em>tools.</em><span class="hero-asterisk" aria-hidden="true">✳</span></span></h1>
  <div class="hero-bottom">
    <p>I’m Lakshmikant Deshpande. Based in Bengaluru, I design backend and distributed systems at PayPal, and build small apps, utilities, and AI experiments in my free time.</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="#selected-work">Explore selected work <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-footnote">
    <span>Staff Software Engineer @ PayPal</span>
    <span>Bengaluru, India · Building & tinkering</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="selected-work" class="section work-section">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow section-number">SELECTED PROJECTS</span>
      <h2>Things I’ve built & shipped.</h2>
    </div>
    <a class="text-link" href="/work/">All projects <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="project-grid">
    {% for project in collections.projects %}
      {% if project.data.featured %}
        {% include 'project-card.njk' %}
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section writing-section">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow section-number">FIELD NOTES</span>
      <h2>Thinking out loud.</h2>
    </div>
    <a class="text-link" href="/writing/">All writing <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="post-list">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
      {% if loop.index <= 3 %}
        {% include 'post-row.njk' %}
      {% endif %}
    {% else %}
      <div class="writing-empty">
        <p class="empty-heading">A notebook, just opened.</p>
        <p>This is where notes on building software, exploring AI, and making small things useful will live. For now, the projects tell the story.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/work/">Explore the projects <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about-teaser section">
  <span class="eyebrow section-number">ABOUT ME</span>
  <div class="about-teaser-grid">
    <h2>Deep in the backend.<br><em>Always building for people.</em></h2>
    <div>
      <p>Over a decade of engineering backend and distributed architectures at PayPal, AppZen, and Persistent taught me how to make systems resilient, scalable, and quiet under load.</p>
      <p>Outside of work, I build small apps and practical AI tools that solve real everyday problems—with simple design, clean code, and zero clutter.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/about/">A little more about me <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="contact-strip">
  <p>Have an idea, a question, or just want to connect?</p>
  <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Say hello. <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
</section>
